OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, falls from double decker
OL,4,Abus window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has fallen out of the
OL,7,Fwindow of a double-decker bus.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,10,Fcalled at about 15:50 BST to the
OL,11,Fincident in Doddington Road,
OL,12,FWimblington.
OL,14,FThe force said emergency services
OL,15,Fremain at the scene and the road was
OL,16,Fblocked due to the incident.
OL,18,FIt added that the boy's injuries were
OL,19,F"unclear at this stage" and did not
OL,20,Fspecify which level of the bus the boy
OL,21,Freportedly fell from.
